unchanged:

  ops.py                  GGML custom operations and GGMLTensor
  dequant.py              dequantisation kernels for the ggml block formats
  loader.py               GGUF readers, image/sd.cpp compatibility mode, the
                          T5 / Llama / Gemma3 / Qwen2VL / Qwen3VL key maps,
                          tokenizer reconstruction
