  tools/                  model -> GGUF conversion and llama.cpp quantization
                          helpers (convert.py, lcpp.patch, fix_5d_tensors.py,
                          read_tensors.py, fix_lines_ending.py)
  LICENSE                 Apache License 2.0, reproduced unmodified

