================================================================================
CHANGES MADE IN THIS FORK (2026, IKBlue)
================================================================================

As required by Apache-2.0 section 4(b), modified files state that they were
changed. The complete list of modifications follows.

  qwen35_support.py  (NEW FILE, Copyright 2026 IKBlue)
      Qwen3.5 ("qwen35") text-encoder support.

      convert_qwen35()
          Remaps a raw qwen35 GGUF onto ComfyUI's native qwen35 checkpoint
          layout: llama.cpp -> comfy key renaming, the RMSNorm +1 centring
          offset, the ssm_a -> A_log log transform, the value-head channel
          permutation, and the conv1d channel-group order. Tensors are
          dequantised on return so load_state_dict sees real storage shapes.

      vision_from_mmproj()
          Converts a Qwen3.5 mmproj GGUF (llama.cpp vision tower) into
          ComfyUI's model.visual.* layout, for text encoder GGUFs that were
          exported language-only.

  nodes_v3.py  (NEW FILE, Copyright 2026 IKBlue)
      All six nodes re-expressed against the ComfyUI V3 schema
      (comfy_api.latest: io.ComfyNode / io.Schema / comfy_entrypoint), plus the
      GGUFCustomNodesExtension and comfy_entrypoint(). Derived from the
      corresponding V1 classes in upstream nodes.py.

  loader.py  (MODIFIED, upstream City96)
      + "qwen35" added to TXT_ARCH_LIST
      + an early qwen35 branch in gguf_clip_loader()
      + an optional vision_path argument that merges the mmproj vision tower
      + a mismatch guard rejecting a vision file that shares keys with the
        text encoder

  nodes.py  (MODIFIED, upstream City96)
      + an optional "vision_name" input on CLIPLoaderGGUF, with
        get_vision_filename_list() to discover mmproj/vision GGUFs
      + node category changed from "bootleg" to "IKBlue"
      + a message typo fix ("Mixig" -> "Mixing")
      The V1 node classes remain available for ComfyUI builds without
      comfy_api.latest.

  __init__.py  (MODIFIED)
      Exports comfy_entrypoint when comfy_api.latest is importable, setting
      NODE_CLASS_MAPPINGS to None so the loader takes the V3 branch; otherwise
      falls back to the V1 NODE_CLASS_MAPPINGS.

  pyproject.toml  (MODIFIED)
      Repointed at this fork; upstream authorship credited in project.urls.

  README.md, NOTICE, CHANGELOG.md  (fork documentation)

  Every other file is upstream, unmodified.

